<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 331 ALL OUT IN FIRST INNINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 331 ALL OUT IN FIRST INNINGS.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 331 all out in their first innings on the second day of the second test at the Sydney Cricket Ground on Saturday.</p>
<p>Score - Australia 331 (Greg Blewett 69) v West Indies.</p>
